## DroneKit — the kit of the Empire's drones (EmpireEnemyData "drone": the
## Scout Drone and the Purge Protocol's Kill-Drone; Act III, GDD §15.0 "Act III
## foundation (phase 1)"). A drone flies over obstacles (its row's "phases")
## and fires single short-range zaps through EmpireShots (EmpireKit's marching
## fire with burst_rounds 1), so Line of Fire applies: a drone zapping the
## necromancer through the army hits the army. A MACHINE: it leaves no corpse.
## Everything else is the shared ranged AI. No RNG.
class_name DroneKit
extends EmpireKit
